I has having a sacrifest near my stash (which is always in a room with an 
altar).  I was fortunate enough to have an ice box in the room.  I got a 
few cockatrice corpses, named each one with the turn number and put them 
in the ice box.  After a while a Ki-Rin wanders in.  Yay no more messing 
with wands and scrolls to create god food.  I went to my ice box, got the 
oldest cockatrice corpse and stoned the Ki-Rin.  I then went to the huge 
pile of monster debris and got a pick-axe.  I dug a one square chamber 
that was surrounded on 7 sides, dropped everything, picked up the Ki-Rin 
statue, TPed to the chamber, dropped the statue, TPed out, and stoned to 
flesh him.  The first bunch of monsters he generated had a black dragon 
who disintegrated some of what I was hoping to sacrifice, the bastard.  I 
killed him, sacrificed him and then went after a green slime.  I killed 
him but got slimmed in the process.

Thinking I'm prepared I went to my ice box and got out a lizard corpse 
and ate it.  It tasted terrible and didn't de-slime me.  OK, maybe it 
wasn't fresh enough, so I went to my chest, got an acid, drank it and 
promptly turned to a green slime.  

Then I realized "Fuck!!! It's fire that de-slimes you."



